            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "building_ignition_damp_modifier;;;;;All projectile contributions to building, vehicle, deployable ignition are multiplied by this amount when raining:::::custom_firestarter_ignite_range;;;;;A preferred range between the firestarters and the target. Leaving this at 0 will use the default torch range. This range is a suggestion, may not be exact in-game.:::::escalation_buildings_on_fire;;;;;percentage of map buildings on fire:::::fire_damage_building_modifier;;;;;Damage dealt to buildings once caught on fire (multiplied by burn rates):::::fire_damage_deployable_modifier;;;;;Damage dealt to deployables once caught on fire:::::fire_damage_siege_vehicle_modifier;;;;;Damage dealt to sige vehicles once caught on fire:::::fire_intensity_increase;;;;;the amount that each ignition points intensity increases per tick:::::fire_propagation_distance;;;;;:::::flammable_object_propagation_frequency;;;;;update in milliseconds:::::ground_ignition_damp_modifier;;;;;All projectile contributions to ground ignition are multiplied by this amount when raining:::::max_distance_of_firestarters_from_main_squad;;;;;Maximum distance (m) a firestarter squad can be from the main squad without being recalled.:::::max_firestarter_search_after_no_targets_found_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Max cooldown ticks (100ms) after finding no nearby targets.:::::max_firestarter_search_radius;;;;;Max search radius (m) for nearby deployables and buildings. Capped in code at 40 for performance reasons.:::::max_firestarter_spawn_after_recall_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Max cooldown ticks (100ms) after recalling a firestarter squad.:::::max_firestarter_spawn_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Max cooldown ticks (100ms) after spawning a new firestarter squad, and on game start.:::::max_num_firestarter_squads;;;;;Max number of fierstarter squads active at once.:::::max_num_firestarters_unit_percentage;;;;;Maximum percentage of a main squad that can be in firestarter squads. max firestarter men = THIS * (main squad men + active firestarter men):::::min_firestarter_search_after_no_targets_found_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Min cooldown ticks (100ms) after finding no nearby targets.:::::min_firestarter_search_radius;;;;;Min search radius (m) for nearby deployables and buildings. Used to stop squads setting fire to targets too close to them.:::::min_firestarter_spawn_after_recall_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Min cooldown ticks (100ms) after recalling a firestarter squad.:::::min_firestarter_spawn_cooldown_ticks;;;;;Min cooldown ticks (100ms) after spawning a new firestarter squad, and on game start.:::::min_num_firestarters;;;;;Min number of men allowed in a firestarter squad. Can override unit_percentage calculation.:::::num_firestarters_unit_percentage;;;;;Num men in a new firestarter squad is based on the size of the main squad. Squad size = NUM MEN * THIS:::::smoking_hit_point_percentage;;;;;At this ignition_threshold percentage the buildings start emitting smoke:::::smoking_ignition_percentage_decrease;;;;;percentage decay per second:::::smoking_ignition_percentage_increase;;;;;percentage increase per second:::::smoking_ignition_threshold_percentage;;;;;threshold at which smoke turn to fire or smoke decays to nothing:::::vegetation_catch_fire_chance;;;;;percentage ignition modifier on defult_fire_spread projectile explosion record.:::::vegetation_propagate_chance_from_smoke_to_fire;;;;;propagation chance from smoke to fire:::::vegetation_propagation_chance;;;;;propagation chance through itself by increasing burn amount:::::vegetation_propagation_frequency;;;;;update in milliseconds",
            },
