        "_kv_morale_tables": {
            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "army_destruction_alliance_strength_ratio;;;;;ratio of current to starting strength needed:::::army_destruction_enemy_strength_ratio;;;;;ratio of enemy to friendly current strength needed:::::artillery_near_miss_distance_squared;;;;;distance squared to consider it a near miss:::::blood_bonus_12;;;;;unit killed 12% of enemy in last 4 sec:::::blood_bonus_5;;;;;unit killed 5% of enemy in last 4 sec:::::blood_bonus_7;;;;;unit killed 7.5% of enemy in last 4 sec:::::broken_finish_base_timeout;;;;;the base timeout for going from broken to rally:::::broken_finish_timer_experience_bonus;;;;;experience_broken_finish_time_bonus is (THIS * unit experience level):::::cavalry_effect_range;;;;;range in which cavalry is considered:::::charge_bonus;;;;;charge bonus:::::charge_timeout;;;;;the timout for morale bonus due to charging:::::commanding_general_alive_effect_amount_max;;;;;the effect is scaled from min to max based on the unit\'s command stars (default: 6):::::commanding_general_alive_effect_amount_min;;;;;the effect is scaled from min to max based on the unit\'s command stars (default: 1):::::difficulty_modifier_ai_easy;;;;;Morale modifier applied to the AI\'s units on easy:::::difficulty_modifier_ai_hard;;;;;Morale modifier applied to the AI\'s units on hard:::::difficulty_modifier_ai_normal;;;;;Morale modifier applied to the AI\'s units on normal:::::difficulty_modifier_ai_very_hard;;;;;Morale modifier applied to the AI\'s units on very hard:::::difficulty_modifier_player_easy;;;;;Morale modifier applied to human player\'s units on easy:::::difficulty_modifier_player_hard;;;;;Morale modifier applied to human player\'s units on hard:::::difficulty_modifier_player_normal;;;;;Morale modifier applied to human player\'s units on normal:::::difficulty_modifier_player_very_hard;;;;;Morale modifier applied to human player\'s units on very hard:::::encouraging_aura_radius;;;;;Radius of aura for units with the \'encouraging\' attribute:::::enemy_control_land_defender_land_force_strength_modifier;;;;;multiplier applied to the defender\'s land strength before comparing to attacker strength as part of the \'enemy_controls_land\' evaluation:::::enemy_effect_range;;;;;range in which enemies are considered:::::enemy_numbers_morale_penalty_multiplier;;;;;This multiplier is applied ot the morale penalty for enemy numbers in the vicinity, which ranges from -1 to -7 (hardcoded). A value of 0 means no penalty is applied.:::::experience_broken_finish_time_bonus_modifier;;;;;The value to be multiplied with the unit experience to calculate the experience_broken_finish_time_bonus:::::extended_casualties_penalty_10;;;;;unit lost 10% hitpoints/entities in last 60 sec:::::extended_casualties_penalty_15;;;;;unit lost 15% hitpoints/entities in last 60 sec:::::extended_casualties_penalty_33;;;;;unit lost 33% hitpoints/entities in last 60 sec:::::extended_casualties_penalty_50;;;;;unit lost 50% hitpoints/entities in last 60 sec:::::extended_casualties_penalty_80;;;;;Unit lost 80% hitpoints/entities in last 60 sec:::::fear_effect_range;;;;;Fear range:::::fighting_cavalry;;;;;Base value (modded by training) against cavalry:::::general_aura_radius;;;;;Base radius of the general\'s passive aura:::::general_inspire_effect_amount_max;;;;;For commanding and non-commanding generals. The effect is scaled from min to max based on the unit\'s command stars (default: 12):::::general_inspire_effect_amount_min;;;;;For commanding and non-commanding generals. The effect is scaled from min to max based on the unit\'s command stars (default: 1):::::inspiration_radius_max_effect_range_modifier;;;;;Unit\'s within the inspiration radius get the full effect, units outside of it will get proportionally weaker effect up to the max range (general_aura_radius*THIS):::::losing_combat;;;;;Unit losing in combat:::::losing_combat_significantly;;;;;Unit significantly losing in combat:::::max_reinforcement_bonus;;;;;Maximum bonus that can be gained from having pending reinforcements:::::max_routing_enemies_to_consider;;;;;Clamp for maximum number of routing enemies, this is then mulitplied by the weighting:::::max_routing_friends_to_consider;;;;;Clamp for maximum number of routing friends, this is then mulitplied by the weighting:::::minimium_increment_update_per_tick;;;;;The minimum amount that the morale will be changed by per tick:::::morale_base;;;;;Starting point for calculations:::::morale_shock_rout_immunity_timer;;;;;The duration of the unit immunity from terror effects from the same enemy:::::morale_shock_rout_timer_long;;;;;Duration of long morale shock rout:::::morale_shock_rout_timer_short;;;;;Duration of short morale shock rout:::::morale_shock_terror_morale_threshold_long;;;;;Terror causes target to go into long morale shock rout if the target\'s current morale is lower or equal than this value:::::morale_shock_terror_morale_threshold_short;;;;;Terror causes target to go into short morale shock rout if the target\'s current morale is lower or equal than this value:::::neighbour_effect_range;;;;;range in which neightbouring units are considered:::::only_units_with_living_commanding_general_may_enter_non_shattered_rout_enabled;;;;;If this is \'true\' then once a unit\'s commander dies the next rout will be a shatter:::::open_flanks_effect_range;;;;;Range at which flanks can lose secured bonus:::::percent_update_per_tick;;;;;The ideal changed morale amount:::::post_rally_no_rout_timer;;;;;Time (in seconds) for which a unit that has just rallied cannot rout again:::::recent_casualties_penalty_10;;;;;Unit lost 10% hitpoints/entities in last 4 sec:::::recent_casualties_penalty_15;;;;;Unit lost 15% hitpoints/entities in last 4 sec:::::recent_casualties_penalty_33;;;;;Unit lost 33% hitpoints/entities in last 4 sec:::::recent_casualties_penalty_50;;;;;Unit lost 50% hitpoints/entities in last 4 sec:::::recent_casualties_penalty_6;;;;;Unit lost 6% hitpoints/entities in last 4 sec:::::recent_casualties_shock_threshold;;;;;% casualties in last 4s needed for morale shock:::::routing_enemies_effect_weighting;;;;;Weighting used to calculate the UME_CONCERNED_FRIENDS_ROUTING, this is multiplied by the rout_balance (enemies_routing - friends_routing):::::routing_friends_effect_weighting;;;;;Weighting used to calculate the UME_CONCERNED_FRIENDS_ROUTING, this is multiplied by the rout_balance (enemies_routing - friends_routing):::::routing_unit_effect_distance_flank;;;;;Routing distance flank:::::routing_unit_effect_distance_front;;;;;Routing distance front:::::shatter_after_first_rout_if_casulties_higher_than;;;;;Casualty threshold for shatter is [(THIS * starting men)<current men]:::::shatter_after_rout_count;;;;;After routing this number of times, units are always shattered:::::shatter_after_second_rout_if_casulties_higher_than;;;;;Casualty threshold for shatter is [(THIS * starting men)<current men]:::::surprise_timeout;;;;;Surprise timeout:::::terror_effect_range;;;;;Terror range:::::total_casualties_penalty_10;;;;;Unit lost 10% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_20;;;;;Unit lost 20% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_30;;;;;Unit lost 30% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_40;;;;;Unit lost 40% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_50;;;;;Unit lost 50% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_60;;;;;Unit lost 60% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_70;;;;;Unit lost 70% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_80;;;;;Unit lost 80% hitpoints/entities in total:::::total_casualties_penalty_90;;;;;Unit lost 90% hitpoints/entities in total:::::ume_concerned_army_destruction;;;;;The army is on the brink of destruction:::::ume_concerned_attacked_by_artillery;;;;;Unit was attacked but not hit by artillery:::::ume_concerned_attacked_by_projectile;;;;;Attacked by projectile:::::ume_concerned_captain_died_recently;;;;;Very recently the captain died:::::ume_concerned_damaged_by_artillery;;;;;Unit was hit and damaged by artillery:::::ume_concerned_elephants_frightened;;;;;Enemy is frightening the elephants:::::ume_concerned_exhausted;;;;;Completely knackered:::::ume_concerned_flanks_exposed_multiple;;;;;Both flanks are exposed:::::ume_concerned_flanks_exposed_single;;;;;One flank is exposed:::::ume_concerned_general_dead;;;;;The general is dead, but not recently:::::ume_concerned_general_dead_ai;;;;;In single player this applies to the ai only:::::ume_concerned_general_died_recently;;;;;Very recently the general died:::::ume_concerned_general_died_recently_ai;;;;;In single player this applies to the ai only:::::ume_concerned_general_fled_recently;;;;;The commanding general has recently fled:::::ume_concerned_general_fled_recently_ai;;;;;In single player this applies to the ai only:::::ume_concerned_horses_frightened;;;;;Enemy is frightening the horses:::::ume_concerned_night_battle_unprepared;;;;;Unprepared for night battle:::::ume_concerned_panic;;;;;The unit is panicking:::::ume_concerned_settlement_destruction_max;;;;;>The amount of this effect applied = ratio_of_buildings_destroyed * ume_concerned_settlement_destruction_max, so the full effect will only be applied when all destructible buildings are destroyed:::::ume_concerned_surprised;;;;;Surprised:::::ume_concerned_tired;;;;;Vigour penalty:::::ume_concerned_under_friendly_fire;;;;;The penalty for being under friendly fire:::::ume_concerned_unit_frightened;;;;;The enemy is frightening:::::ume_concerned_very_tired;;;;;Unit is very tired but not exhausted:::::ume_encouraged_flanks_secure;;;;;All flanks are secure:::::ume_encouraged_fortification;;;;;Unit is defending inside a fort:::::ume_encouraged_fortification_compromised;;;;;Morale bonus for being inside a breached fort:::::ume_encouraged_inspired;;;;;Friendly is having an inspiring effect on you:::::ume_encouraged_on_the_hill;;;;;Bonus for being up-hill of all enemies:::::ume_encouraged_settlement_plaza;;;;;Defending central plaza:::::ums_broken_threshold_lower;;;;;Broken bottom:::::ums_broken_threshold_upper;;;;;Broken top:::::ums_confident_threshold_lower;;;;;(% basis)confident bottom:::::ums_confident_threshold_upper;;;;;(% basis)confident top:::::ums_eager_threshold_lower;;;;;(% basis)eager bottom:::::ums_eager_threshold_upper;;;;;(% basis)eager top:::::ums_impetuous_threshold_lower;;;;;(% basis)impetuous bottom:::::ums_shaken_threshold_lower;;;;;Shaken bottom:::::ums_shaken_threshold_upper;;;;;Shaken top:::::ums_steady_threshold_lower;;;;;Steady bottom:::::ums_steady_threshold_upper;;;;;(% basis)steady top:::::ums_wavering_threshold_lower;;;;;Wavering bottom:::::ums_wavering_threshold_upper;;;;;Wavering top:::::unit_inspire_effect_amount;;;;;Used for non-command units and applied as a flat value (adjusted for distance). NOT based on rank:::::use_hitpoints_instead_of_casualties_prop_in_morale_calculation;;;;;Whether the casualties penalty percentage refers to the unit\'s remaining hitpoints (1) or to the unit\'s remaining entities (0):::::warcry_effect_range;;;;;NOT USED:::::was_attacked_in_flank;;;;;First contact from flank:::::was_attacked_in_front;;;;;First contact from front:::::was_attacked_in_rear;;;;;First contact from rear:::::waver_base_timeout;;;;;The base time for which a unit spends in waver:::::winning_combat;;;;;Unit winning in combat:::::winning_combat_significantly;;;;;Unit significantly winning in combat:::::winning_combat_slightly;;;;;Unit winning slightly in combat",
            },
        },
