            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "admiral_influence_range;;;;;range in which the admiral\'s effects are applied:::::kill_and_damage_bonus_12;;;;;ship has killed/damaged 12% of equivalent ship:::::kill_and_damage_bonus_5;;;;;ship has killed/damaged   5% of equivalent ship:::::kill_and_damage_bonus_7;;;;;ship has killed/damaged   7% of equivalent ship:::::ship_broken_finish_base_timeout;;;;;the base timout for going from broken to rally:::::ship_casualty_surrender_threshold;;;;;the number of crew needed to be alive befor surren:::::ship_extended_casualties_penalty_13;;;;;ship has lost 13% of men in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_casualties_penalty_22;;;;;ship has lost 22% of men in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_casualties_penalty_30;;;;;ship has lost 30% of men in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_casualties_penalty_50;;;;;ship has lost 50% of men in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_casualties_penalty_7;;;;;ship has lost 7% of men in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_damage_penalty_10;;;;;ship has received 10% damages in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_damage_penalty_20;;;;;ship has received 20% damages in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_damage_penalty_40;;;;;ship has received 40% damages in last 60 seconds:::::ship_extended_damage_penalty_5;;;;;ship has received   5% damages in last 60 seconds:::::ship_fear_range;;;;;range in which passive fear effect is applied:::::ship_inspiration_range;;;;;range in which passive inspiration effect is appli:::::ship_morale_base;;;;;starting point for morale calculations:::::ship_neighbourhood_range;;;;;ships within this range are neighbouring:::::ship_operational_guns_penalty_40;;;;;ship has lost 40% of its operational guns:::::ship_operational_guns_penalty_75;;;;;ship has lost 75% of its operational guns:::::ship_recent_casualties_penalty_13;;;;;ship has lost 13% of men in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_casualties_penalty_2;;;;;ship has lost   2% of men in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_casualties_penalty_22;;;;;ship has lost 22% of men in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_casualties_penalty_30;;;;;ship has lost 30% of men in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_casualties_penalty_7;;;;;ship has lost   7% of men in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_casualties_shock_threshold;;;;;the % amount (last 4s) needed for a morale shock:::::ship_recent_damage_penalty_10;;;;;ship has received 10% damages in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_damage_penalty_15;;;;;ship has received 15% damages in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_damage_penalty_30;;;;;ship has received 30% damages in last 4 seconds:::::ship_recent_damage_penalty_6;;;;;ship has received   6% damages in last 4 seconds:::::ship_total_casualties_penalty_20;;;;;ship has lost 20% of men onboard:::::ship_total_casualties_penalty_40;;;;;ship has lost 40% of men onboard:::::ship_total_casualties_penalty_60;;;;;ship has lost 60% of men onboard:::::ship_total_casualties_penalty_80;;;;;ship has lost 80% of men onboard:::::ship_total_casualties_penalty_90;;;;;ship has lost 90% of men onboard:::::ship_total_damage_penalty_10;;;;;ship has lost 10% of its total hitpoints:::::ship_total_damage_penalty_20;;;;;ship has lost 20% of its total hitpoints:::::ship_total_damage_penalty_40;;;;;ship has lost 40% of its total hitpoints:::::ship_total_damage_penalty_5;;;;;ship has lost 5% of its total hitpoints:::::ship_total_damage_penalty_60;;;;;ship has lost 60% of its total hitpoints:::::ship_waver_base_timeout;;;;;waver timeout:::::sme_concerned_admiral_dead;;;;;the admiral is dead, long live the captain:::::sme_concerned_admiral_dead_ai;;;;;:::::sme_concerned_admiral_died_recently;;;;;the admiral just died:::::sme_concerned_admiral_died_recently_ai;;;;;:::::sme_concerned_admiral_fled_recently;;;;;the admiral has just fled the battle:::::sme_concerned_admiral_fled_recently_ai;;;;;:::::sme_concerned_demasted;;;;;the ship has lost its masts:::::sme_concerned_frightened;;;;;the ship is frightened by a scary enemy:::::sme_concerned_on_fire;;;;;the ship is visibly on fire:::::sme_concerned_panic;;;;;the unit is in panic:::::sme_concerned_rear_attacked;;;;;ships rear is under attack from ship in rear:::::sme_concerned_rear_exposed;;;;;an enemy threatens the rear of ship:::::sme_concerned_under_attack;;;;;being attacked by some kind of projectile:::::sme_encouraged_boarding;;;;;the ship is excited about it\'s boarding action:::::sme_encouraged_inspired;;;;;friendly ship is having an inspiring effect on you:::::sme_encouraged_rear_secure;;;;;ship has its rear protected by friendly:::::sms_broken_threshold_lower;;;;;broken bottom:::::sms_broken_threshold_upper;;;;;broken top:::::sms_confident_threshold_lower;;;;;confident bottom:::::sms_confident_threshold_upper;;;;;confident top:::::sms_eager_threshold_lower;;;;;lower threshold for transition to eager:::::sms_shaken_threshold_lower;;;;;shaken lower:::::sms_shaken_threshold_upper;;;;;shaken upper:::::sms_steady_threshold_lower;;;;;steady lower:::::sms_steady_threshold_upper;;;;;steady top:::::sms_wavering_threshold_lower;;;;;lower threshold for transition from steady:::::sms_wavering_threshold_upper;;;;;wavering top",
