            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "boarding_bonus_time;;;;;time after ships dock for bonus to be applied to attackers:::::boarding_melee_attack_bonus;;;;;attack bonus for attackers during boarding actions.:::::boarding_melee_defense_bonus;;;;;defence bonus for attackers during boarding actions:::::broadsides_accuracy_modifier;;;;;:::::broadsides_damage_modifier;;;;;:::::ship_backwater_minimum_distance;;;;;Minimum value the backwater extent can be reduced to:::::ship_backwater_radius_modifier_default;;;;;Maximum seconds the ship can backwater for - used with ship walk speed to create radius of valid movement area:::::ship_backwater_speed_percentage_default;;;;;Ships backwater at this percentage of their walk_speed:::::ship_backwater_vector_degrees_default;;;;;The degrees creating the backwater valid movement area:::::ship_beaching_location_offset;;;;;How deep the ship goes onto the beach:::::ship_boarding_pipes_max_length_default;;;;;:::::ship_chance_of_fire_rain_multiplier;;;;;The probability of a projectile causing a fire is multiplied by this amount when raining:::::ship_combustion_rain_multiplier;;;;;The rate of ship combustion is multiplied by this amount when raining:::::ship_douse_fire_absolute_per_tick;;;;;:::::ship_douse_fire_percentage_pre_tick;;;;;How many percent of max hp is healed per tick:::::ship_fire_damage_rain_modifier;;;;;Multipiler to the amount fire damage ships take when it is raining:::::ship_landing_location_offset;;;;;Ships move to this many meters in front of the landing point before beaching:::::ship_marker_mouse_over_offset_back;;;;;On mouseover markers for ships, how much to offset from back of ship:::::ship_marker_mouse_over_offset_front;;;;;On mouseover markers for ships, how much to offset from front of ship:::::ship_marker_mouse_over_padding;;;;;On mouseover markers for ships, how much to pad out for capsule shape (not lens):::::ship_marker_padding_length;;;;;On mouseover/selection markers for ships, how much to pad out length of marker:::::ship_marker_padding_width;;;;;On mouseover/selection markers for ships, how much to pad out width of marker:::::ship_on_fire_combustion_modifier;;;;;modifying the rate of combustion:::::ship_on_fire_hit_points_per_second_multiplier;;;;;:::::ship_repair_max_percentage;;;;;max repair percentage:::::ship_repair_percentage_per_update;;;;;percentage of repair each update:::::ship_repair_rate;;;;;repairs every x seconds related to the proportion of the marines, seamen and gunners",
            },
