        "campaign_variables_tables": {
            "variable_key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "abandon_settlement_income_percentage_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) When abandoning settlements; percentage modifier on income:::::abandon_settlement_per_faction_province_desolation_public_order_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order penatly for each settlement abandoned, for each province the faction ownes. Applies next turn only.:::::abandon_settlement_per_faction_province_uncertainty_public_order_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order penatly for each settlement abandoned, for each province the faction ownes. Stored value reducing by 1 each turn.:::::additional_rebellion_army_quality_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) If an additional rebel army were to spawn in a region, change the army generator budget variable \'quality multiplier\' by this:::::additional_rebellion_army_quality_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) If an additional rebel army were to spawn in a region, change the army generator budget variable \'quality offset\' by this:::::additional_rebellion_building_percent_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) If an additional rebel army were to spawn in a region, damage the buildings by this percent:::::agent_action_kick_character_target_loyalty_upper_bound;;;;;Upper bound inclusive target character loyalty for performing \"kick character\" action:::::agent_action_loyalty_reduction_target_loyalty_lower_bound;;;;;Lower bound inclusive target character loyalty for performing \"reduce character loyalty\" action:::::agent_action_loyalty_reduction_target_loyalty_upper_bound;;;;;Upper bound inclusive target character loyalty for performing \"reduce character loyalty\" action:::::agent_action_sabotage_gates_repair_rounds;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds gates will be sabotaged for agent actions:::::ai_governor_independence_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME)  Modifier value used during independence scoring logic for AI entities:::::ai_grant_independence_percentage_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage chance whether or not to grant independence to AI factions:::::ambush_army_attacker_reinforcement_delay;;;;;(IN GAME) Time in seconds that the attackers reinforcements are delayed by in an ambush:::::ambush_critical_fail_proportion_of_fail;;;;;(IN GAME) Ambush will roll on chance of success, generated from ground type and bonus values. The chance of failure is split into failure and critical failure. The propotion of failure that is critical is defined here. Clamped between 0.0 and 1.0:::::area_of_interest_spline_width;;;;;(IN GAME) Width of area of interest splines:::::armed_citizenry_army_percentage_on_change_hands;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of the maximum garrisoned army armed citizenry force that will exist immediately after a region has changed hands.:::::armed_citizenry_navy_percentage_on_change_hands;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of the maximum garrisoned navy armed citizenry force that will exist immediately after a region has changed hands.:::::autoresolver_alliance_wipe_out_loser_strength_of_max_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Losing alliance must be at least below X unary of maximum for wipe out. from 0.0 to 1.0. E.g. Force max soldiers is 200, end soldier count is 50, threshold will check against 50/200 = 0.25.:::::autoresolver_alliance_wipe_out_winner_loser_strength_multiple;;;;;(IN GAME) Winning alliance must be above X proportion strength to wipe out loser. Must be positive. E.g. Winner has 200 units, Loser has 30 units, calculation will check against (200/30) = 6.66:::::autoresolver_battle_damage_modifier_full_naval_units_at_sea;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage multiplier for full naval units in autoresolver sea battles. 1.0 is no change.:::::autoresolver_battle_damage_modifier_non_naval_units_at_sea;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage multiplier for army transport units in autoresolver sea battles. 1.0 is no change.:::::autoresolver_battle_excess_melee_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Scale for damage applied by excess melee units in the autoresolver. Must be > 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_excess_melee_damage_received_from_target_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Scale for damage recieved by excess melee units in the autoresolver. Must be > 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_max_tower_morale_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum multiplier for morale damage a unit can take from siege towers in one round:::::autoresolver_battle_missile_range_modifier_used_in_ranged_combat;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier on the missile range used in ranged combat. Units will query the BCOP using a range of THIS*effective_missile_range.:::::autoresolver_battle_naval_ramming_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage multiplier to ramming damage of ships. Ramming damage is applied at the same time as melee damage.:::::autoresolver_battle_naval_ramming_initial_seperation;;;;;(IN GAME) Initial seperation when calculating ship ramming damage in unit vs unit. Combat prediction is Ramming vs Passive.:::::autoresolver_battle_num_defender_towers_in_fortified_settlement;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of towers for the defender in fortified autoresolver battle.:::::autoresolver_battle_num_defender_towers_in_unfortified_settlement;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of towers for the defender in unfortified autoresolver battle.:::::autoresolver_battle_reinforcement_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The battle time a reinforcement arrives on the field. 0 will be instant (waiting for them to arrive). Must be positive:::::autoresolver_battle_result_accuracy_high_prediction_variation;;;;;(IN GAME) variation in autoresolver predictions. Must be positive or 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_result_accuracy_low_prediction_variation;;;;;(IN GAME) variation in autoresolver predictions. Must be positive or 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_result_accuracy_moderate_prediction_variation;;;;;(IN GAME) variation in autoresolver predictions. Must be positive or 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_result_accuracy_very_high_prediction_variation;;;;;(IN GAME) variation in autoresolver predictions. Must be positive or 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_result_accuracy_very_low_prediction_variation;;;;;(IN GAME) variation in autoresolver predictions. Must be positive or 0.:::::autoresolver_battle_result_battle_complexity_max_units_for_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Scales the generals autoresolver accuracy. The scale is linear from (0 units) to (THIS value), with the accuracy multiplied from (0) to (1). The scale is calculated as ((lowest num units in alliace) / THIS):::::autoresolver_battle_siege_initial_seperation;;;;;(IN GAME) Initial seperation of armies in an autoresolver siege battle:::::autoresolver_battle_timestep;;;;;(IN GAME) The time step of autoresolver battles. Must be positive. Small values will misrepresent unit stats. Large values will misrepresent range and movement.:::::autoresolver_battle_tower_base_kps;;;;;(IN GAME) Base kps for towers. Kps is reduced by target unit shield effectiveness and target unit size.:::::autoresolver_battle_tower_level_1_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier on autoresolver tower damage for level 1 towers. Calculated as (damage = (base_damage * THIS)):::::autoresolver_battle_tower_level_2_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier on autoresolver tower damage for level 2 towers. Calculated as (damage = (base_damage * THIS)):::::autoresolver_battle_tower_level_3_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier on autoresolver tower damage for level 3 towers. Calculated as (damage = (base_damage * THIS)):::::autoresolver_battle_tower_level_4_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier on autoresolver tower damage for level 4 towers. Calculated as (damage = (base_damage * THIS)):::::autoresolver_battle_tower_rounds_after_melee_damage_cutoff;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds after melee that towers continue to fire for in the autoresolver:::::autoresolver_bound_max_ammo_per_second_mod_unit_size;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum ammo per sec based on full unit size. Max ammo per second is VALUE * unit_size.:::::autoresolver_bound_max_melee_strength_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) Max melee kills per second proportion of enemy unit. Kills per second can only be VALUE times larger than opponent.:::::autoresolver_bound_max_ranged_kills_per_second;;;;;(IN GAME) Max ranged kills per second. Flat amount, must be VALUE or below.:::::autoresolver_bound_min_melee_kills_per_second_full_strength;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum kills per second at full strength. Min kills per second is VALUE * combat time (calculated in combat prediction):::::autoresolver_bound_min_ranged_kills_per_ammo_mod_unit_size;;;;;(IN GAME) Min kills per ammo is AMMO USED / (VALUE) * full unit size:::::autoresolver_bound_min_ranged_kills_per_second;;;;;(IN GAME) Min ranged kills per second flat value.:::::autoresolver_building_damage_num_assult_equipment_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver percentage building damage per enemy siege euqipment:::::autoresolver_building_damage_num_units_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver percentage building damage per enemy unit:::::autoresolver_casualty_unary_received_by_excess_melee_units_from_target;;;;;(IN GAME) When alliance has more units in melee than opponent (excess melee units), the amount of damage they take from the unit they attack:::::autoresolver_chase_down_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier for chase down damage (post battle):::::autoresolver_chase_down_loser_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) multiply the chase down damage by this modifier for losing units:::::autoresolver_chase_down_maximum_damage_unary;;;;;(IN GAME) maximum damage done in chase down phase, as a unary of full health:::::autoresolver_chase_down_speed_comparison_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) maximum value for the speed comparison calculation:::::autoresolver_chase_down_speed_comparison_divider;;;;;(IN GAME) used in the speed comparison calcuation:::::autoresolver_chase_down_surviver_ratio_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) multiply the surviver units ratio by this value:::::autoresolver_chase_down_winner_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) multiply the chase down damage by this modifier for winning units:::::autoresolver_damage_transfer_diff_from_average_to_transfer;;;;;(IN GAME) The difference in heath lost to mark a unit to have damaged transferred from them. E.g. 0.2 means that if the average health lost is 0.15, units with health loss of > 0.35 will be marked.:::::autoresolver_damage_transfer_enabled;;;;;(IN GAME) Value > 0 to enable post battle damage transfer:::::autoresolver_damage_transfer_max_diff_from_average_after_transfer;;;;;(IN GAME) The max difference from average health lost. E.g.  0.3 means that if the average health loss it 0.15, transferring units should lose a maximum of 0.45. The exact value depends on the original damage taken, and will be in the range (0.15-0.45) in this example:::::autoresolver_damage_transfer_min_health_remaining;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum proportion of health a \"transfering to\" unit can drop to. E.g. 0.2 means that units won\'t drop below 20% of their max health:::::autoresolver_damage_transfer_proportion_of_alliance;;;;;(IN GAME) Proportion of damaged units that are split into the \"transfer damage from\" list. All theer damaged units are put into the \"transfer damage to\" list:::::autoresolver_duel_additional_duel_mod_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Modification to duel chance which scales with the number of duels that have already occured in this battle:::::autoresolver_duel_base_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance of duel to happen in the autoresolver:::::autoresolver_duel_chance_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Max autoresolver duel chance:::::autoresolver_duel_chance_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Min. autoresolver duel chance:::::autoresolver_duel_character_mod_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Modification to duel chance which scales with the number of characters in the battle:::::autoresolver_duel_max_limit;;;;;(IN GAME) Max number of duels that can occur in the autoresolver:::::autoresolver_duel_refuse_variable;;;;;(IN GAME) Controls how a large a difference in combat potential between two characters is necessary for them to refuse a duel:::::autoresolver_flying_skirmish_units_use_entire_combat_time;;;;;(IN GAME) If non-zero then when the autoresolver is calculating outcomes between a flying unit and a non-flying melee unit in a skirmish situation then the flying unit uses the entire skirmish combat time.:::::autoresolver_flying_unit_melee_damage_dealt_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage modifier on damage dealt by flying creatures to non-flying creatures in melee in the autoresolver.:::::autoresolver_flying_unit_melee_damage_received_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage modifier on damage received by flying creatures from non-flying creatures in melee in the autoresolver.:::::autoresolver_mana_pool_per_round_per_mana_cost_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount by which the autoresolver unary mana pool is reduced per round, per point of mana cost of all spells in an alliance.:::::autoresolver_max_attackers_damaging_a_flanked_single_target_in_excess_melee;;;;;(IN GAME) Sim based battle, the maximum number of units that can attack a single enemy unit in excess melee flanking:::::autoresolver_max_attackers_damaging_a_single_target_in_excess_melee;;;;;(IN GAME) Sim based battle, the maximum number of units that can attack a single enemy unit in excess melee:::::autoresolver_max_hp_for_enemy_hp_dps_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Used in autoresolver modifiers. Enemey hp modifier is multiplied by (MAX_HP - ENEMY_HP) / (MAX_HP - MIN_HP).:::::autoresolver_min_battle_time_before_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) The min battle time before units can retreat. Must be positive:::::autoresolver_min_hp_for_enemy_hp_dps_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Used in autoresolver modifiers. Enemey hp modifier is multiplied by (MAX_HP - ENEMY_HP) / (MAX_HP - MIN_HP).:::::autoresolver_num_excess_melee_units_receiving_casualties_from_target;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of excess melee units that take damage from their targets:::::autoresolver_num_units_multiplier_vs_enemy_to_allow_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of units on the field multiplier to allow units to retreat. can retreat if num_units * VALUE > enemy_num_units.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_buff_kps_modifier_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) KPS modifier applied in the autoresolver by a buff special ability with scaled combat potential of one.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_buff_kps_modifier_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) KPS modifier applied in the autoresolver by a buff special ability with scaled combat potential of zero.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_cp_to_strength_divider;;;;;(IN GAME) Combat potential value for special abilities in autoresolver that results in a scaled combat potential of one.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_damage_damage_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage done in the autoresolver by a damage special ability with scaled combat potential of one.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_damage_damage_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage done in the autoresolver by a damage special ability with scaled combat potential of zero.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_damage_range;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum distance between the closest opposing units in the autoresolver before damage special abilities will be used.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_debuff_kps_modifier_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) KPS modifier applied in the autoresolver by a debuff special ability with scaled combat potential of one.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_debuff_kps_modifier_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) KPS modifier applied in the autoresolver by a debuff special ability with scaled combat potential of zero.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_maximum_strength_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) Scaled combat potentials in the autoresolver are clamped to be no higher than this when applied.:::::autoresolver_special_ability_minimum_strength_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) Scaled combat potentials in the autoresolver are clamped to be no lower than this when applied.:::::autoresolver_unit_base_retreat_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Starting unit stregth retreat threshold. Between 0 and 1. unit retreats is strength is less than VALUE * 100 percent.:::::autoresolver_unit_wipe_out_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Remaning strength of a unit to wipe out. Unit will be wiped out if strength percentage < VALUE * 100. Between 0 and 1:::::autoresolver_wall_damage_num_artillery_units_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver percentage wall damage per enemy srtillery unit:::::autoresolver_winner_additional_building_damage_num_assult_equipment_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver percentage building damage per enemy siege euqipment if defenders lose:::::autoresolver_winner_additional_building_damage_num_units_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver percentage building damage per enemy unit if defenders lose:::::autoresolver_winner_additional_wall_damage_per_wall_breach;;;;;(IN GAME) Autoresolver wall damage, additional damage per additional wall breach:::::autoresolver_winner_kpd_major_win_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Kills per casualty for battle to be major win. Major win if KPC is > VALUE:::::autoresolver_winner_kpd_minor_win_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Kills per casualty for battle to be major win. Minor win if KPC is < VALUE:::::autoresolver_wipe_out_army_force_unary_lost;;;;;(IN GAME) Strength lost for an army to wipe out. Army will be wiped out if strength lost percentage > VALUE * 100. Between 0 and 1:::::background_resource_supply;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of resource units always available on the global market for each resource (to prevent division by zero).:::::base_building_dismantle_recoup_cost_unary;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of building cost refunded when a building is dismantled:::::base_force_retinues_deployable_per_turn;;;;;(IN GAME) Base number of retinues deployable per turn. Can be increased by bonus values.:::::base_number_of_simultaneous_faction_province_building_construction_projects_allowed;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of new, upgrade and conversion building construction items that are permitted to be in progress in one faction province at any one time. Can be increased by bonus values.:::::base_undercover_characters_max_count;;;;;(IN GAME) Base number of active undercover characters a faction can have:::::besieged_attrition_force_size_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The besiegers force size as a percentage of the besieged force size must exceed this threshold for besieged attrition to apply:::::blockaded_attrition_force_size_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The blockaders force size as a percentage of the blockaded force size must exceed this threshold for blockade attrition to apply:::::bonus_start_of_campaign_income_for_humans_on_easy_difficulty;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional starting funds on easy difficulty:::::bonus_start_of_campaign_income_for_humans_on_normal_difficulty;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional starting funds on normal difficulty:::::border_display_border_width;;;;;(IN GAME) Campaign map border widths:::::border_display_overlay_border_width;;;;;(IN GAME) Campaign map overlay border widths:::::brige_battle_detection_path_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Distance to check from the end of an attackers path to find river crossings when detecting river battles:::::building_conversion_cost_reduction_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage (as a decimal) cost reduction to buildings which are converted:::::building_cultural_conversion_cost_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier to the cost of converting a building from another culture. This can be modified by bonus values.:::::building_cultural_conversion_time_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier to the time of converting a building from another culture. This can be modified by bonus values.:::::building_min_conversion_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum cost of coverting a building, cultural or normal conversion.:::::building_slum_creation_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of turns a slot is empty or ruined before turning into a slum.:::::building_slum_dismantle_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The base cost of dismantling a slum. This can be modified by bonus values. This can be modified by bonus values.:::::building_upkeep_is_paid_while_building_is_constructing;;;;;(IN GAME) If non-zero then building upkeep is charged as soon as a building starts constructing.:::::bulding_dismantle_instant_complete_cost_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier for dismantle building instant complete cost..:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_far_z;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the far plane distance of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the far plane distance of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_key_step_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Rate of zoom modifier when using the hotkey:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_maximum_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the max distance from the actual target to the real target:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_maximum_dof_falloff_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field near/far falloff multiplier applied at maximum camera height:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_maximum_fov;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the field of view angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the field of view angle of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_maximum_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the max height for the camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_maximum_tilt_angle;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the maximum tilt angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the maximum tilt angle of the campaign camera relative to -y:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_minimum_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the min distance from the actual target to the real target:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_minimum_dof_falloff_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field near/far falloff multiplier applied at minimum camera height:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_minimum_fov;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the field of view angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the field of view angle of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_minimum_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the min height for the camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_minimum_tilt_angle;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the minimum tilt angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the minimum tilt angle of the campaign camera relative to -y:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_mousewheel_step_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Rate of zoom modifier when using the mousewheel:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_near_z;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the near plane distance of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the near plane distance of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_min_q;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum point along the camera spline which the camera can reach:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_control_1_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline first segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_control_1_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline first segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_control_2_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline first segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_control_2_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline first segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline first segment distance:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_1_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline first segment height:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_control_1_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline second segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_control_1_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline second segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_control_2_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline second segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_control_2_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline second segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline second segment distance:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_2_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline second segment height:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_control_1_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline third segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_control_1_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline third segment first control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_control_2_horizontal;;;;;(IN GAME) Horizontal position of the camera spline third segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_control_2_vertical;;;;;(IN GAME) Vertical position of the camera spline third segment second control point:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline third segment distance:::::camera_angle_dependent_on_zoom_spline_segment_3_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Camera spline third segment height:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_far_z;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the far plane distance of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the far plane distance of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_fov;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the field of view angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the field of view angle of the campaign camera:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_maximum_height;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum height the camera can reach in campaign:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_maximum_tilt_angle;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the maximum tilt angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the maximum tilt angle of the campaign camera relative to -y:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_minimum_height;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum height the camera can reach in campaign:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_minimum_tilt_angle;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the minimum tilt angle of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the minimum tilt angle of the campaign camera relative to -y:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_mousewheel_step_val;;;;;(IN GAME) Rate of zoom when using the mousewheel:::::camera_angle_independent_from_zoom_near_z;;;;;(IN GAME) Set the near plane distance of the campaign camera\", \"Sets the near plane distance of the campaign camera:::::camera_forward_displacement;;;;;(IN GAME) How many units does the camera move forward as it approaches max tilt:::::camera_mousewheel_faster_step_start_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Height at which the camera zooms usign the faster step value:::::camera_mousewheel_faster_step_val;;;;;(IN GAME) Faster rate of zoom for camera:::::camera_parchment_blend_start;;;;;(IN GAME) Height at wchich blending in of the parchment map starts, starting at 0% opacity and reaching 100% at zoom threshold 2:::::camera_tilt_threshold_1;;;;;(IN GAME) First tilt threshold height:::::camera_tilt_threshold_1_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Portion of the range between min tilt and max tilt the tilt threshold 2 represents:::::camera_tilt_threshold_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Second tilt threshold height:::::camera_tilt_threshold_2_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Portion of the range between min tilt and max tilt the tilt threshold 1 represents:::::camera_vertical_threshold_1;;;;;The height threshold where we change to simpler representation of settlement and army icons:::::camera_vertical_threshold_2;;;;;(IN GAME) The height at which the parchment overlay becomes visible:::::campaign_camera_max_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum height the campaign map camera will scroll to. Actual height not scale or normal.:::::campaign_diplomacy_minimum_display_priority_to_show_in_event_feed;;;;;(IN GAME) Campaign diplomacy treaty components with display priority below this value will not be displayed in the event feed. If all components in a deal are below this priority the deal will not show up at all.:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_shroud_fpdelta_minimum;;;;;The minimum faction potential difference used to bias autoresolver battles fought between A.I. factions under the shroud:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_vs_player_easy;;;;;Faction potential used for A.I. vs player battles on easy difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_vs_player_hard;;;;;Faction potential used for A.I. vs player battles on hard difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_vs_player_legendary;;;;;Faction potential used for A.I. vs player battles on legendary difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_vs_player_normal;;;;;Faction potential used for A.I. vs player battles on normal  difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_ar_vs_player_vhard;;;;;Faction potential used for A.I. vs player battles on vhard difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_difficulty_mod_easy;;;;;difficulty modifier for campaign faction potential on easy difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_difficulty_mod_hard;;;;;difficulty modifier for campaign faction potential on hard difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_difficulty_mod_legendary;;;;;difficulty modifier for campaign faction potential on legendary difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_difficulty_mod_normal;;;;;difficulty modifier for campaign faction potential on normal difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_difficulty_mod_vhard;;;;;difficulty modifier for campaign faction potential on very hard difficulty:::::campaign_faction_potential_fp_delta_kps_min;;;;;Minimum difference in faction potential which will cause kills per second modification to be applien in the autoresolver:::::campaign_faction_potential_fp_delta_max;;;;;Maximum faction potential delta between two factions in autoresolver battle:::::campaign_faction_potential_hp_regain_multiplier_max;;;;;Maximum multiplier for hit point regain after autoresolver battle:::::campaign_faction_potential_kps_multiplier_max;;;;;Maximum kills per second multiplier applied due to faction potential differences in the autoresolver:::::campaign_faction_potential_max_potential;;;;;Maximum possible value of faction potential:::::campaign_faction_potential_min_potential;;;;;Minimum possible value of faction potential:::::campaign_faction_potential_shroud_multiplier;;;;;maximum faction potential modification multiplier for A.I. vs A.I. battles in the shroud:::::campaign_variable_character_loyalty_maximum_turns_idle;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum amount of turns a character being idle can effect their loyalty for:::::campaign_variable_character_loyalty_maximum_turns_not_idle;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum amount of turns a character not being idle can effect their loyalty for:::::captive_execution_loot_base_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Basic amount of treasury to gain when executing a character. Multiplied by wealth level:::::character_captives_last_wound_capture_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Additive percentage modifier applied to a characters escape chance if they\'re on their last wound.:::::character_captives_maximum_captives_from_battle;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum number of characters that can be captured during a battle:::::character_captives_minimum_rank_to_capture;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum rank a character must achieve before being valid for capture:::::character_captives_past_experience_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Increased value of character captive if they have a past experience with the capturing faction:::::character_captives_relationship_in_faction_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Increased value of the character captive if they have a relationship with a character in the capturing faction:::::character_captives_relationship_in_force_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Increased value of character captive if they have a relationship with a character present in the capturing force:::::character_convalescence_time_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Base time for which a character will convalesce:::::character_creation_max_age;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum age for new characters:::::character_creation_min_age;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum age for new characters:::::character_defection_diplomatic_stance_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Weighting factor for sorting algorithm used for determining preferred faction to defect based on faction stance:::::character_defection_distance_between_two_regions_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Weighting factor for sorting algorithm used for determining preferred faction to defect:::::character_defection_is_at_war_weight_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Weight factor used when picking preferred non civil war faction:::::character_defection_round_buffer;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds a character spends in a faction before they are eligible for defection:::::character_defection_same_sub_culture_weight_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Weight factor used when picking preferred non civil war faction:::::character_defection_strength_weight_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Weight factor used when picking preferred non civil war faction:::::character_loyalty_new_hire_boost;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of loyalty a character gains as a boost when they join a new faction:::::character_loyalty_new_hire_boost_per_turn_decay;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of loyalty the new faction boost decays by every turn:::::character_pools_faction_pool_num_max_characters;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper bound for size of per-faction pools that are not assigned to any group:::::character_pools_faction_pool_num_median_characters;;;;;(IN GAME) Median size of per-faction pools  that are not assigned to any group:::::character_pools_faction_pool_num_min_characters;;;;;(IN GAME) Lower bound for size of per-faction pools  that are not assigned to any group:::::character_pools_full_update_frequency;;;;;(IN GAME) Frequency of full updates to character pools:::::character_pools_partial_update_frequency;;;;;(IN GAME) Frequency of partial updates to character pools:::::character_pools_target_characters_per_pool;;;;;(IN GAME) Target characters in each character pool:::::character_pools_update_first_round_active;;;;;(IN GAME) Period before the character pools redistribuition begins:::::character_random_spouse_age_range_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper bound of random spouse age:::::character_random_spouse_age_range_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Lower bound of random spouse age:::::character_relationship_maximum_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum value that a character relationship value ascend to:::::character_relationship_minimum_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum value that a character relationship can degrade to:::::character_relationship_payload_threshold_large;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum value at which the relationship payload will display the large ui_payload_record:::::character_retirement_turns_until_available;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of turns after retiring a general before they are available to be recruited again.:::::character_wounds_default_time;;;;;(IN GAME) default num turns wounds last on a character:::::civil_war_trigger_threshold_character_rank_ratio;;;;;(IN GAME) (sum of joining separatists rank / sum of loyalists rank) >= this value:::::damaged_building_dismantle_recoup_cost_unary;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of building cost refunded when a damaged building is dismantled:::::deploy_retinue_cost_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) gamewide multiplier on retinue deploy cost:::::destruction_zone_recovery_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns taken for the landscape to recover after a destruction incident:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_hard_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be behind, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_hard_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be behind for, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_hard_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be behind by, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_normal_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be behind, normal difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_normal_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be behind for, normal difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_normal_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be behind by, normal difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_very_hard_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be behind, very hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_very_hard_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be behind for, very hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_decrease_recommendation_very_hard_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be behind by, very hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_easy_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be ahead of, easy difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_easy_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be ahead for, easy difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_easy_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be ahead by, easy difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_hard_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be ahead of, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_hard_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be ahead for, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_hard_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be ahead by, hard difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_normal_num_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of factions to be ahead of, normal difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_normal_num_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns to be ahead for, normal difficulty:::::difficulty_level_increase_recommendation_normal_prestige_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of prestige to be ahead by, normal difficulty:::::diplomacy_all_factions_always_have_permission_to_enter_each_others_territory;;;;;(IN GAME) If zero then factions by default take a diplomatic hit when moving armies into other faction territory (Total War: Rome 2-style military access):::::diplomacy_all_factions_can_always_physically_enter_each_others_territory;;;;;(IN GAME) If zero then factions by default are physically unable to move armies into other faction territory (Empire: Total War-style military access):::::diplomacy_can_trade_regions_to_recipient_regardless_of_adjacency_and_traversability;;;;;(IN GAME) If non-zero then factions can trade regions that are not adjacent to the recipient or are adjacent to them but cannot be traversed to.:::::diplomacy_can_trade_regions_which_are_adjacent_to_recipient_but_not_traversably_so;;;;;(IN GAME) If diplomacy_can_trade_regions_to_recipient_regardless_of_adjacency_and_traversability is zero and this is non-zero then factions can trade regions that are adjacent to the recipient but not traversable from the recipient.:::::diplomacy_can_trade_regions_which_are_adjacent_to_recipient_but_not_traversably_so_but_are_in_same_province;;;;;(IN GAME) If diplomacy_can_trade_regions_to_recipient_regardless_of_adjacency_and_traversability and diplomacy_can_trade_regions_which_are_adjacent_to_recipient_but_not_traversably_so are both zero and this is non-zero then factions can trade regions that are adjacent to the recipient but not traversable from the recipient if the region is in a province where the recipient owns at least one other region.:::::diplomacy_maximum_client_or_vassal_regular_tribute_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum amount of its income a client state or vassal will give to its protector or master each turn.:::::diplomacy_show_trespass_message_each_turn;;;;;(IN GAME) If non-zero then show messages for trespassing armies at the start of each turn.:::::display_building_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Global scale applied to all buildings in the game:::::display_character_model_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Base scale applied to characters on campaign map.:::::display_movement_arrow_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds for movement arrow to fade in or out.:::::display_movement_extents_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds for movement extents to fade in or out.:::::display_settlement_area_land_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds for settlement land areas to fade in or out.:::::display_settlement_area_sea_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds for settlement sea areas to fade in or out.:::::display_ship_model_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Base scale applied to ships on campaign map.:::::display_time_of_day_day_battle_hour;;;;;(IN GAME) Hour we fast forward to when day battle is selected:::::display_time_of_day_day_battle_hour_rand_range;;;;;(IN GAME) Size of range we use uniform random at to add value to \'display_time_of_day_day_battle_hour\' in the middle:::::display_time_of_day_night_battle_hour;;;;;(IN GAME) Hour we fast forward to when night battle is selected:::::display_time_of_day_night_battle_hour_rand_range;;;;;(IN GAME) Size of range we use uniform random at to add value to \'display_time_of_day_night_battle_hour\' in the middle:::::display_time_of_day_night_battle_transition_length;;;;;(IN GAME) Length in seconds of transition to/from night battle:::::display_time_of_day_speed_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Time of day speed multiplier:::::display_time_of_day_speed_multiplier_ai_turn;;;;;(IN GAME) Time of day speed multiplier for AI turn:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_and_neutral_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval tr