s (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_enemy_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction and enemy factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_enemy_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction and enemy factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_and_neutral_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_and_neutral_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_and_neutral_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_enemy_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and enemy factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions who are blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_and_neutral_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded and neutral factions (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blockaded_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction when blockaded (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue naval trade routes are when used by your faction (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green naval trade routes are when used by your faction (0-255).:::::display_trade_naval_route_colour_owned_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red naval trade routes are when used by your faction (0-255).:::::display_trade_route_fade_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Distance trader models fade over.:::::display_trade_route_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of milliseconds to fade trade routes over.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) The scale of trade carts/ships for a trade route of maximum flow.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in milliseconds between trade carts/ships for a trade route of maximum flow.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper value limit for trade route display. Trade routes with values greater than this are displayed as if they had this value.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) The scale of trade carts/ships for a trade route of minimum flow.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in milliseconds between trade carts/ships for a trade route of minimum flow.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The lower value limit for trade route display. Trade routes with values less than this are displayed as if they had this value.:::::display_trade_route_sea_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The relative time taken for a trade ship to travel the same distance as a trade cart.:::::display_trade_route_trader_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The distance offset of the trader to the left of the route in units.:::::display_trade_route_trader_speed;;;;;(IN GAME) The speed of trade carts in units/second.:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_blue;;;;;(IN GAME) How blue the tunnel interception battle path line is (0-255).:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_end_fade_length;;;;;(IN GAME) How much (length) of the ends of the tunnel interception battle path line fade out.:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of seconds for tunnel interception battle path line to fade in or out.:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_green;;;;;(IN GAME) How green the tunnel interception battle path line is (0-255).:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_red;;;;;(IN GAME) How red the tunnel interception battle path line is (0-255).:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_tiling_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) How the tunnel interception battle path line texture repeats - larger numbers mean more repetitions.:::::display_tunnel_interception_path_width;;;;;(IN GAME) The width of the tunnel interception battle path line.:::::display_zone_of_control_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds for zones of control to fade in or out.:::::distribute_template_characters_to_human_factions;;;;;(IN GAME) Only distribute template character entries to human faction pools if > 0:::::dof_bokeh_hotspot_kernel_size;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Brightness kernel size of detecting hotspots for splat:::::dof_bokeh_intensity;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Bokeh sprite splat intensity:::::dof_bokeh_sprite_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Radius of sprite used to splat bokeh:::::dof_bokeh_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Brightness difference threshold for displaying bokeh:::::dof_far_falloff;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - The fall off of focus in the background:::::dof_focal_ring_cross_count;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - The number of focal cross in the ring used to focus the camera:::::dof_focal_ring_cross_size;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - Width in pixels of the crosses used to focus the camera:::::dof_focal_ring_dilation;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - Dilation of the ring of focus:::::dof_focal_ring_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - Radius of the ring of crosses used to focus:::::dof_focal_target_height;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - Focal target height on the screen as a proportion of the vertical resolution:::::dof_kernel_radius_background;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Radius of blur kernal in the background:::::dof_kernel_radius_foreground;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Radius of blur kernal in the foreground:::::dof_kernel_radius_foreground_coc;;;;;(IN GAME) DOF, Radius of blur kernal used to smudge the circle of confusion in the foreground:::::dof_moving_average_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - The weight applied to the focal parameters from this frame - used to smooth transition during camera movement:::::dof_near_falloff;;;;;(IN GAME) Depth of field - The fall off of focus in the foreground:::::economic_power_gdp_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier applied to gdp when calculating economic power:::::economic_power_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper bound for economic power:::::economic_power_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Lower bound for economic power:::::economic_power_treasury_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier applied to current treasury when calculating economic power:::::economic_wealth_category_threshold_moderate;;;;;(IN GAME) In diplomacy, when demanding payments from AI, if the economic strength is at least this high, the wealth category of the AI faction will be at least moderate (or higher):::::economic_wealth_category_threshold_strong;;;;;(IN GAME) In diplomacy, when demanding payments from AI, if the economic strength is at least this high, the wealth category of the AI faction will be at least strong (or higher):::::economic_wealth_category_threshold_very_strong;;;;;(IN GAME) In diplomacy, when demanding payments from AI, if the economic strength is at least this high, the wealth category of the AI faction will be very strong:::::economic_wealth_category_threshold_weak;;;;;(IN GAME) In diplomacy, when demanding payments from AI, if the economic strength is at least this high, the wealth category of the AI faction will be at least weak (or higher):::::economic_wealth_max_amount_moderate;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper limit on the amount of money the player can demand from a faction in diplomacy if the target faction\'s wealth level is in the medium category.:::::economic_wealth_max_amount_strong;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper limit on the amount of money the player can demand from a faction in diplomacy if the target faction\'s wealth level is in the high category.:::::economic_wealth_max_amount_very_strong;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper limit on the amount of money the player can demand from a faction in diplomacy if the target faction\'s wealth level is in the highest category.:::::economic_wealth_max_amount_very_weak;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper limit on the amount of money the player can demand from a faction in diplomacy if the target faction\'s wealth level is in the lowest category.:::::economic_wealth_max_amount_weak;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper limit on the amount of money the player can demand from a faction in diplomacy if the target faction\'s wealth level is in the low category.:::::economics_additional_tribute_percentage_per_settled_horde_unit;;;;;(IN GAME) For each army in settle stance in client/vassal regions, the units will be summed up and NUM_UNITS*VALUE extra tribute will be granted to the master/protector. This is a percentage, should be 0-100.:::::economics_max_additional_tribute_percentage_for_settled_hordes;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum extra tribute from armies settled in client/vassal regions. This is a percentage, should be between 0-100.:::::employment_history_join_date_turn_range;;;;;(IN GAME) Start pos character employment history will display a random initial join date between the campaign start date and this many turns into the past. Will not override coming of age limits.:::::employment_history_rejoin_round_limit;;;;;(IN GAME) Characters rejoining the same faction within this round limit will not get an additional employment history entry:::::enable_scripted_pathfinding_restrictions;;;;;(IN GAME) If non-zero scripted pathfinding restrictions are enabled at start of game.:::::end_turn_notification_low_imperial_favour_amount;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of imperial favour below which the player will recieve an end turn notification:::::end_turn_notification_low_provincial_supplies_amount;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of provincial supplies below which the player will receive an end turn notification that one of their provinces has low resources:::::end_turn_notifications_faction_council_turns_since_issue;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds that must have elapsed since the last faction council mission was issued, to warn the player about it with an end turn notification:::::end_turn_notifications_low_funds_amount;;;;;(IN GAME) Treasury amount below which the player will receive an end turn warning. Paired with low_funds_income_amount:::::end_turn_notifications_low_funds_income_amount;;;;;(IN GAME) Income amount below which the player will receive an end turn warning. Paired with low_funds_amount:::::end_turn_notifications_low_public_order_amount;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order balance below which the player will receive an end turn warning about a provinces public order:::::enslave_captives_hitpoints_replenished_per_man_captured;;;;;(IN GAME) How many hitpoints are replenished on hitpoint using units for each captive when enslaving captives post-battle.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_difference_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) For post-battle replenishment, defines rhe most extreme difference in percentage replenishment between two units, i.e. a value of 2 means that at most one unit might replenish twice as many men as another. The higher the number, the less uniform the replenishment. Minimum value is one.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on very hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_human_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_human_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_human_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_human_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_maximum_replenishment_percentage_human_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on very hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the AI on very hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_human_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_human_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_human_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_human_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_minimum_replenishment_percentage_human_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum percentage of your original army that will be replenished via the post-battle captives option for the human on very hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the AI on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the AI on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the AI on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the AI on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_ai_vs_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the AI on very hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_human_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the human on easy difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_human_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the human on hard difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_human_legendary;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the human on legendary difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_human_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the human on normal difficulty.:::::enslave_captives_replenishment_percentage_human_very_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of captives that can be recovered into your army via the post-battle captives option for the human on very hard difficulty.:::::event_generation_addition_chance_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional chance (unary) of generating an event at the start of a round. Added for every round elapsed that an event was not generated on:::::event_generation_additional_dilemma_weight_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional weighting to generate a dilemma added per-round since the last dilemma generated:::::event_generation_additional_incident_weight_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional weighting to generate a incident added per-round since the last incident generated:::::event_generation_additional_mission_weight_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional weighting to generate a mission added per-round since the last mission generated:::::event_generation_base_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance of generating an event at the start of a round (unary):::::event_generation_base_dilemma_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance of generating a dilemma over a mission or incident:::::event_generation_base_event_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) [PERCENTAGE] Base chance of an event firing if there\'s no VAR CHANCE defined for it:::::event_generation_base_incident_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance of generating an incident over a mission or dilemma:::::event_generation_base_mission_weight;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance of generating a mission over an incident or dilemma:::::event_generation_min_rounds_between_events;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum number of rounds between random events:::::event_generation_start_round;;;;;(IN GAME) First round that random events can start to occur:::::faction_death_min_character_survival_rank;;;;;(IN GAME) Any character specified rank value will be killed instead of being added back to pool:::::faction_fondness_percentage_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage chance to consider picking highest priority fond faction during character pool redistribution:::::faction_gdp_other;;;;;(IN GAME) Background gdp value.:::::faction_gdp_other_minor;;;;;(IN GAME) Background gdp value for minor nations.:::::faction_income_percentage_from_governed_region;;;;;(IN GAME) The base percentage of the region gdp that the owning faction gains from the region when a governor is present.:::::faction_strategic_direct_threat_event_multiplier_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum multiplier that diplomatic events can contribute to direct strategic threat calculations:::::faction_strategic_threat_alliance_military_force_strength_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier applied to allied forces military strength before being combined with the factions own military strength:::::faction_strategic_threat_event_multiplier_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum multiplier that diplomatic events can contribute to strategic threat calculations:::::faction_strategic_threat_maximum_event_age;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum age (in rounds) a diplomatic event can be before it stops counting towards strategic threat calculations:::::faction_strategic_threat_region_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) This is used as a multiplier to the number of regions a faction has that is used in strategic threat calculations.:::::faction_strategic_threat_world_leader_ally_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) This is used as a flat bonus to strategic threat calculations, if the faction is a world leader.:::::faction_strategic_threat_world_leader_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) This is used as a flat bonus to strategic threat calculations, if an ally or a master is a world leader.:::::factions_involved_in_civil_wars_can_absorb_others_into_their_confederations;;;;;(IN GAME) If zero then factions involved in civil wars cannot confederate with other factions.:::::factions_involved_in_civil_wars_can_be_absorbed_into_confederations;;;;;(IN GAME) If zero then factions involved in civil wars cannot be confederated by other factions.:::::factionwide_recruitment_time_base_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Factionwide recruitment, base multiplier on recruitment time:::::factionwide_recruitment_time_period_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Factionwide recruitment, number of additional buildings required to reduce recruitment time:::::family_age_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which family members can first be considered adults.:::::family_age_of_guaranteed_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which family members will definitely be considered adults.:::::family_base_child_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The base chance of family members having a child.:::::family_base_child_chance_reduction_per_child;;;;;(IN GAME):::::family_base_illegitimate_child_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage chance that a character will have a bastard child:::::family_base_illegitimate_child_chance_reduction_per_child;;;;;(IN GAME):::::family_chance_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The chance each turn that a child of appropriate age will be considered adult.:::::family_emergent_faction_leader_maximum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum age of a daimyo created on faction emergence.:::::family_emergent_faction_leader_minimum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum age of a daimyo created on faction emergence.:::::family_infant_mortality_chance_very_young;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage chance a child willl die before the age of 6:::::family_infant_mortality_chance_young;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage chance a child will die before they come of age:::::family_rounds_between_children;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds that must pass after a child is born before the parents may have another child.:::::family_rounds_between_marriage_and_first_child;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds that must pass after family members marry before they can have a child.:::::family_turns_before_any_chance_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of turns at start of game before any non-adult family member can be considered adult.:::::family_wife_barren_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which women cease to have children.:::::famous_battles_chance_of_adding_ai_battle;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance of a fully AI battle being added as a famous battle.:::::famous_battles_max_allowed;;;;;(IN GAME) Max amount of famous battles on map.:::::famous_battles_minimum_casualties_required;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum total casualties required for a battle to be considered famous.:::::famous_battles_minimum_force_required;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum men required (per side) for a battle to be considered famous.:::::famous_battles_minimum_units_per_side;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum units required (per side) for a battle to be considered famous.:::::food_shortage_system_food_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines food level when maximum bonuses apply for positive and negative food effects.:::::food_shortage_system_food_shortage_cap_global_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiples the food cap when a faction is in food shortage, whilst applying penalties to negative-production provinces and forces:::::food_shortage_system_growth_mod_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum growth mod bonus for positive and negative food effects.:::::food_shortage_system_income_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum income bonus for positive food effects.:::::food_shortage_system_income_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines scaling factor for income bonus for positive food effects. Applied after cap is applied.:::::food_shortage_system_local_food_shortages_food_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum local food shortage value.:::::food_shortage_system_local_food_shortages_penalty_cap_horde;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum penalty for local food shortage effects (for hordes):::::food_shortage_system_local_food_shortages_penalty_cap_non_horde;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum penalty for local food shortage effects (for non-hordes):::::food_shortage_system_morale_mod_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum morale mod bonus for negative food effects.:::::food_shortage_system_replenishment_mod_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Part of food shortage system. Defines maximum replenishment mod bonus for negative food effects.:::::general_admiral_action_point_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) The base general/admiral action point bonus:::::gift_base_value_large;;;;;(IN GAME) Unmodified lower bound for large gifts:::::gift_base_value_medium;;;;;(IN GAME) Unmodified lower bound for medium gifts:::::gift_base_value_small;;;;;(IN GAME) Unmodified lower bound for small gifts:::::governor_independence_denied_defection_score_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Loyalty/satisfaction check for defection when independence is denied.:::::governor_independence_denied_loyalty_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Applies a penalty by deducting loyalty with specified factor value if governor independence is denied:::::governor_tax_administration_percentage_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage modifier on tax administation cost of regions where a governor is present.:::::home_region_score_original_home_region_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Home region suitability scoring - bonus if a region is your original home region:::::home_region_score_original_home_region_is_province_captial_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Home region suitability scoring - bonus if a region is your original home region and is a province capital:::::home_region_score_province_captial_region;;;;;(IN GAME) Home region suitability scoring - province capital:::::home_region_score_world_leader_region;;;;;(IN GAME) Home region suitability scoring - world leader region:::::horde_host_spawn_development_point_carry_over;;;;;(IN GAME) Base dev points for newly created horde armies:::::horde_host_spawn_development_point_cost_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Base dev point cost for new hordes:::::horde_host_spawn_development_point_cost_current_host_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Dev point cost mod for new hordes (sum is base + (num_hordes * mod)):::::horde_infighting_ai_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) Infighting food ai consumption per army:::::horde_infighting_ai_gdp_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Infighting GDP ai percentage mod per army:::::horde_infighting_attrition_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius in which hordes are considered close enough for horde infighting:::::horde_infighting_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) Infighting food consumption per army:::::horde_infighting_gdp_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Infighting GDP percentage mod per army:::::is_family_member_governor_independence_score_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Used for calculating scoring factor upon denying independence request. The result is used to determine whether character will defect immediately or not based on threshold value. Score = Satisfaction + (SCORE_MODIFIER):::::loot_casualties_modifer;;;;;(IN GAME) Fraction modifier on the fraction of the unit recruitment recieved in loot for killing men in that unit:::::loot_commander_agent_cost_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Fraction modifier on killed commander agent cost for looting:::::loot_commander_total_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Fraction modifier on total amount of loot from killed commander:::::loot_fraction_recruitment_cost_recieved_per_routed_unit;;;;;(IN GAME) Fraction of the units recruitment cost received in loot should that unit route:::::loot_per_agent_level;;;;;(IN GAME) Loot amount recieve in addtion to a characters recruitment cost per level when they are killed in battle:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_close_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_close_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_crushing_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_close_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_close_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_crushing_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_decisive_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_decisive_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_draw;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_heroic_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_pyrrhic_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decay_start_valiant_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Turns at which effect of battle result starts to deminish:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decisive_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_decisive_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_dirrect_faction_multiplier;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result multiplier for dirrect faction relationship:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_draw;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_heroic_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_pyrrhic_victory;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_interfaction_battle_result_valiant_defeat;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Interfaction loylaty from battle result:::::loyalty_jealousy_base_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Base value for loyalty effect applied per difference level in rank between two characters per post:::::loyalty_ministerial_positions_desired_power_rating_loyalty_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The loyalty effect of a character desiring a post is calculated as (current office rating - desired office rating) * this * bonus_multiplier.:::::loyalty_ministerial_positions_desired_power_rating_per_rank;;;;;(IN GAME) Direct multiplier of character rank to calculate the power rating of position they want. Can be a float, final value will be floored:::::loyalty_personal_loyalty_interfaction_max;;;;;(NOT IN USE)  Maximum interfaction personal loyalty which a character can recieve when they are created:::::loyalty_personal_loyalty_interfaction_min;;;;;(NOT IN USE) Minimum interfaction personal loyalty which a character can recieve when they are created:::::loyalty_personal_loyalty_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum personal loyalty which a character can recieve when they are created:::::loyalty_personal_loyalty_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum personal loyalty which a character can recieve when they are created:::::loyalty_risk_low;;;;;(IN GAME) The lowest based character loyalty level:::::map_road_objects_display_spawn_interval_extra_random;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper bound for ranger we pick uniform random number to add to \'map_road_objects_display_spawn_interval_min\' value when checking if new map road object model can be spawned. Seconds.:::::map_road_objects_display_spawn_interval_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum interval between new map road object spawns from the same region. Seconds.:::::map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum trade model spawn frequency that is set when trade value is map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_value_max:::::map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum trade model spawn frequency that is set when trade value is map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_value_min:::::map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_value_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper bound for trade value used for trade model spawn frequency calculation:::::map_road_objects_display_trade_frequency_value_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Lower bound for trade value used for trade model spawn frequency calculation:::::max_civilians_at_settlement_development_level;;;;;(IN GAME) The settlement development level that uses that maximum number of civilians. Lower settlement development level will use ((development level / THIS)  * max num civilians) civilians.:::::max_num_civilians_in_non_settlement_battle;;;;;(IN GAME) The max number of civilians that can be deployed in a non settlement battle (for largest unit sizes). Also determines the max number of civilians that can be deployment in custom battles!:::::max_num_civilians_in_settlement_battle;;;;;(IN GAME) The max number of civilians that can be deployed in a settlement battle (for largest unit sizes):::::max_num_wall_mounted_artillery;;;;;(IN GAME) Max number of wall mounted artillery provided to battle. This must be set to the minimum across all battle maps.:::::max_siege_equipment;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum allowed siege equipment:::::maximum_faction_leader_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum possible amount of daimyo honour.:::::maximum_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum possible amount of general loyalty.:::::maximum_world_leader_regions;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum number of world leader regions:::::military_force_building_build_new_development_point_cost_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate dev cost to build in empty slot for military forces. Cost is (THIS * num slots built on). Must be > 0.:::::military_force_building_health_attrition_damage_inflicted;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to attrition. Will damage buildings random THIS health for every (CVAR) percentage attrition suffered.:::::military_force_building_health_attrition_percentage_suffered;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to attrition. Will damage buildings random (CVAR) health for every THIS percentage attrition suffered.:::::military_force_building_health_casualties_damage_inflicted;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to battle loss.. Will damage buildings random THIS health for every (CVAR) percentage battle damage suffered.:::::military_force_building_health_casualties_percentage_suffered;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to battle loss. Will damage buildings random (CVAR) health for every THIS percentage battle damage suffered.:::::military_force_building_health_sabotage_damage_inflicted;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to sabotage. Will damage buildings random THIS health for every (CVAR) percentage unit sobtage damage suffered.:::::military_force_building_health_sabotage_percentage_suffered;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate military force building damage due to sabotage. Will damage buildings random (CVAR) health for every THIS percentage unit sobtage damage suffered.:::::military_force_building_raze_development_point_refund_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate the dev point refund after razing a military force building. Refund is (total spent on building * THIS). Myst be > 0.:::::military_force_building_repair_cost_dev_point_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate the dev point repair cost for military forces. Repair cost is (THIS * dev cost of building level being repaired). Must be > 0.:::::military_force_development_max_development_points;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum num development points a military force can store.:::::military_force_development_point_growth_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Military force growth required for a new development point. Is code restricted to be at least 1.:::::military_force_morale_attrition;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale modifier due to attrition:::::military_force_morale_bankruptcy;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty while bankrupt:::::military_force_morale_battle_lost_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) No turns loosing a battle effects morale:::::military_force_morale_battle_won;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus from winning a battle:::::military_force_morale_battle_won_relative_strength_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier on rate at which morale recieved from winning a battle falls off based on the relative stength of the armies involved:::::military_force_morale_battle_won_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) No turns winning a battle effects morale:::::military_force_morale_bettle_lost;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty for loosing a battle:::::military_force_morale_casualties_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty multiplied for level of casualties with army:::::military_force_morale_decimated;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus for decimation:::::military_force_morale_decimated_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) No turns decimating a force effects morale:::::military_force_morale_faction_leader_death;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty for faction leader death:::::military_force_morale_faction_leader_death_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) No turns that faction leader death effects morale:::::military_force_morale_foriegn_soil;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty for army being on foriegn soil:::::military_force_morale_idle;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus for being idle:::::military_force_morale_kings_own;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus from being lead by the faction leader:::::military_force_morale_looted_settlement_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus base for looting:::::military_force_morale_looted_settlement_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus multiplier for looting:::::military_force_morale_looted_settlement_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) No turns looting a settlment effects morale:::::military_force_morale_low_level;;;;;(IN GAME) Low threashold at which military force morale is considered low:::::military_force_morale_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Max possible morale:::::military_force_morale_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Min possible morale:::::military_force_morale_post_waaagh;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty when coming out of waaagh:::::military_force_morale_post_waaagh_rate_of_decay;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount the post waaagh penalty is reduced by each turn:::::military_force_morale_post_waaagh_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns post waaagh panalty lasts for:::::military_force_morale_raiding;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus from raiding:::::military_force_morale_released_captives_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns releasing captives morale penalty lasts:::::military_force_morale_starting_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The initial morale value for military forces:::::military_force_morale_transfer_penalty_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale penalty for transferring:::::military_force_morale_very_low_level;;;;;(IN GAME) Low threashold at which military force morale is considered very low:::::military_force_morale_waaagh;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus for reaching Waaagh:::::military_force_morale_waaagh_army_budget_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) Scale applied the computed waaagh army military force generator budget:::::military_force_morale_waaagh_rate_of_decay;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount the waaagh bonus decreases by each turn:::::military_force_morale_waaagh_required_morale;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of morale required for a waaagh to be possible:::::military_force_morale_waaagh_required_num_units;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of units required by an army before a Waaagh is possible:::::military_force_morale_waaagh_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns waaagh bonus lasts for:::::military_force_slots_auto_repair_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of building damage repaired by auto_repair per horde at the end of a turn.:::::minimum_faction_leader_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum possible amount of daimyo honour.:::::minimum_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum possible amount of general loyalty.:::::minimum_religion_support_for_state_religion_change;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum religion support required to switch religion.:::::passive_detection_region_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Passive spying calculation region bonus:::::past_experience_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of past experiences to cache for a any given character:::::past_experience_happiness_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Loyalty value that determines if the character is happy or not:::::pathfinding_land_to_sea_beach_transition_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Action point cost to travel from land to sea across a beach.:::::pathfinding_sea_to_land_beach_transition_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Action point cost to travel from sea to land across a beach.:::::percent_siege_duration_to_reach_escalation_2_at_max_strength;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of the length of a siege it would take a full sized army to reach escalation level 2:::::percent_siege_duration_to_reach_escalation_2_at_min_strength;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of the length of a siege it would take a 1 unit army to reach escalation level 2:::::plague_force_to_force_battle_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague force to force in battle:::::plague_force_to_force_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague force to force:::::plague_force_to_region_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague force to region:::::plague_region_to_force_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague region to force:::::plague_region_to_region_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague region to region:::::plague_sea_to_region_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a sea region to region:::::plague_trade_to_region_infectivity_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Mutiplier for infectivity of a plague trade to region:::::politics_intrigue_chance_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage chance by which the chance of a political intrigue occuring is incremented each turn:::::politics_ministerial_position_cost_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier for the cost a appointing a character to a ministerial position:::::politics_ministerial_position_order_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Modifier for the order when comutting chnace of appointing a character to a ministerial position:::::politics_power_ratio_political_contribution;;;;;(IN GAME) Proportion of political power that comes from the number of senators:::::politics_senate_support_loss_bankruptcy;;;;;(IN GAME) Senator support lost per turn while your faction is bankrupt:::::post_battle_region_debuff_bundle_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns the post-battle region debuff bundle applies for:::::primary_slot_building_religion_conversion_cost_mod_lower_bound;;;;;(IN GAME) Cost modifier lower bound when converting primary slot building to a new religion. Based on province % culture. If 100%, cost modifier will be this value.:::::primary_slot_building_religion_conversion_cost_mod_upper_bound;;;;;(IN GAME) Cost modifier upper bound when converting primary slot building to a new religion. Based on province % culture. If 0%, cost modifier will be this value.:::::province_development_max_development_points;;;;;(IN GAME) Max unspent development points in a province:::::province_development_threshold_cal_points_addition;;;;;(IN GAME) Addition to the number of points used when calculating province development thresholds. Part of Jan\'s algorithm.:::::province_development_threshold_calc_points_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) multiplier on the total number of development points in a region when calculating development point threshold.:::::province_fertility_abandon_region_penalty_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns the fertility raze penalty is applied.:::::province_public_order_devastation_per_damaged_building_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) Defines penalty public order receives from every damaged building:::::province_public_order_max_repression_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Max value for faction province manager repression threshold.:::::province_public_order_max_satisfaction_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Max value for faction province manager satisfaction threshold.:::::province_public_order_min_repression_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Min value for faction province manager repression threshold.:::::province_public_order_min_satisfaction_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) Min value for faction province manager satisfaction threshold.:::::province_public_order_rebellion_defeated_region_not_owned_not_spawned_crackdown;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order craskdown bonus when a rebellion is defeated. Must be > 0. Rebellion is defeated in a province you own at least one region in. They are defeated in another faction\'s region and were spawned by another faction.:::::province_public_order_rebellion_defeated_region_not_owned_spawned_crackdown;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order craskdown bonus when a rebellion is defeated. Must be > 0. Rebellion is defeated in a province you own at least one region in. They are defeated in another faction\'s region, but your faction spawned the rebellion.:::::province_public_order_rebellion_defeated_region_owned_not_spawned_crackdown;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order craskdown bonus when a rebellion is defeated. Must be > 0. Rebellion is defeated in a region you owned, but was spawned by another faction.:::::province_public_order_rebellion_defeated_region_owned_spawned_crackdown;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order craskdown bonus when a rebellion is defeated. Must be > 0. Rebellion is defeated in a region you owned, and was spawned by your faction.:::::public_order_happiness_per_turn_in_rebellion;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of PO added per turn whilst in rebellion state:::::public_order_luxury_resource_available_attitude;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional attitude for faction province a luxury resource is available (and isn\'t produced locally). Per luxury resource available. Used in faction province public order - resource attitude.:::::public_order_luxury_resource_production_attitude;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional attitude for faction province if it produces a luxury resource. Per luxury resource produced. Used in faction province public order - resource attitude.:::::public_order_luxury_resource_value;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum resource value for a resource to be luxury. Used in faction province public order - resource attitude.:::::public_order_military_force_garrison_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiply public order value from garrison by this modifier:::::raid_faction_diplomatic_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Dipolmatic penalty for each faction raided. Positive value X diplomatic penalty.:::::raid_faction_province_development_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Development penalty for each faction province raided. Positive value X accumilated development.:::::raid_faction_province_public_order_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order penalty for each faction province raided. Positive value X happiness.:::::raid_settlement_building_value_exponent;;;;;(IN GAME) Settlement raid building value exponent:::::raid_settlement_per_army_value_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Settlement raid, flat multiplier on raided value:::::raid_settlement_raiding_armies_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Settlement raid count of armies base:::::rebel_army_num_characters_to_spawn;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of characters to create in case of a rebellion:::::rebel_budget_factor_army;;;;;(IN GAME) Rebellion budget calculation factor for the cost of armies in the region and neighbouring region. Result capped at 10000.:::::rebel_budget_factor_garrison;;;;;(IN GAME) Rebellion budget calculation factor for the cost of garrison armies/navies:::::rebel_budget_factor_settlement_buildings;;;;;(IN GAME) Rebellion budget calculation factor for the total building level in the settlement.:::::rebel_budget_factor_settlement_slot;;;;;(IN GAME) Rebellion budget calculation factor for the number of active settlement slots.:::::rebel_budget_factor_unhappiness;;;;;(IN GAME) Rebellion budget calculation factor for unhappiness level. Result capped at 10000.:::::region_building_minimum_cost_to_repair_as_percentage_of_full_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum amount a region building repair can cost, as a percentage of it\'s construction cost.:::::region_horde_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) Food consumption in a region for each horde:::::region_horde_settled_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) Food consumption in a region for each settled horde:::::region_raid_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) Food consumption in a region for each raiding army:::::region_raid_food_consumption_per_unit;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional food consumed by raiding armies in the region they are in. VALUE * number of units, rounded up. Must be greater than 0.0:::::region_raid_food_proportion_stolen;;;;;(IN GAME) Proportion of food stolen from a region given to the raiding armies faction. Must be between 0.0 and 1.0.:::::region_recent_battle_heavy_damage_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) The food penalty after a battle with heavy settlement damage (66+% building damage). Lasts one turn, next turn will use moderate damage penalty.:::::region_recent_battle_light_damage_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) The food penalty after a battle with light settlement damage  (33-% building damage). Lasts one turn.:::::region_recent_battle_moderate_damage_food_consumption;;;;;(IN GAME) The food penalty after a battle with medium settlement damage  (33-66% building damage). Lasts one turn, next turn will use light damage penalty.:::::region_sanitation_plague_chance_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Variable affecting the chance of plague - Chance = (net_squalor * modifier) / (net_squalor + modifier):::::regional_faction_support_owner_support_independent_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Rate at which support will drift towards 0 when there is no owner to a region:::::reinforcement_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum distance from the edge of a zone of control a piece can be to reinforce.  Clamped between 0.1 and 4.0:::::release_captives_income_unit_cost_unary;;;;;(IN GAME) Unary applied to the total unit cost of the enemy alliance to calculate the amount of treasury income received when releasing captives from battle:::::religion_drift;;;;;(IN GAME) Religion drift multiplier. Used for calcuting the religion rate of change in provinces. New religion amount = old + ((new - old) * drift):::::replenishment_base_land;;;;;(IN GAME) Base replenishment rate for land units in owned or allied regions:::::replenishment_base_sea;;;;;(IN GAME) Base replenishment rate for naval units in owned, allied or shared sea regions:::::replenishment_bonus_land_garrisoned_in_owned_province;;;;;(IN GAME) Replenishment rate bonus for land units garrisoned in wholly owned provinces:::::replenishment_bonus_land_garrisoned_in_shared_province;;;;;(IN GAME) Replenishment rate bonus for land units garrisoned in shared provinces:::::replenishment_bonus_land_owned_region;;;;;(IN GAME) Replenishment rate bonus for land units in owned regions:::::retinue_slot_health_percent_reduction_when_replacing_a_unit;;;;;(IN GAME) When replacing a unit in a retinue slot, the percentage health lost of the existing unit. E.g Current unit A at X% health, replaced with unit B at (X - THIS)% health.:::::retinue_slot_unit_convalescing_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) After a military force retinue slot unit is destroyed, number of turns before they respawn:::::round_modifier_since_last_governor_independence_request_default;;;;;(IN GAME) Default value used to track governor independence score modifier value.:::::round_modifier_since_last_governor_independence_request_interval;;;;;(IN GAME) Random factor that is added to round_modifier_since_last_governor_independence_request_default from -X to +X range:::::ruined_building_dismantle_recoup_cost_unary;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of building cost refunded when a ruined building is dismantled:::::safeguard_max_usable_entries_in_character_pool_ai_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) The absolute max number of non child pool entries that the game expects in a ai faction.:::::safeguard_max_usable_entries_in_character_pool_human_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) The absolute max number of child pool entries entries that the game expects in a human faction.:::::safeguard_max_usable_recruited_characters_ai_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) The absolute max number of recruitable characters that the game expects in a ai faction.:::::safeguard_max_usable_recruited_characters_human_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) The absolute max number of recruitable characters that the game expects in a human faction.:::::separatist_army_spawn_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius around which seperatist armies should spawn from the loyalist capital:::::settlement_auto_repair_building_health_points_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) The health points autorepaired to one building in a settlement each turn.:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 1:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_1_province_capital;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 1:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 2:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_2_province_capital;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 2:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_3;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 3:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_3_province_capital;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 3:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_4;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 4:::::settlement_development_point_cost_secondary_slot_4_province_capital;;;;;(IN GAME) Num development points to activate secondary slot 4:::::settlement_loot_value_multiplier_replenish_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) The increase per round of a settlements loot value multiplier.:::::settlement_secondary_slot_unlock_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Points required to unlock a settlement secondary slot (points specified in campaign_building_chain_slot_unlocks):::::settlement_wall_repair_points_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Base repair rate for settlement walls:::::siege_attrition_grace_rounds;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds a besieged force can hold for without taking attrition, after supplies have run out:::::siege_attrition_number_of_turns_override;;;;;(IN GAME) Any non-negative value is used to initialise the number of turns a military force can hold out after supplies run out. If a negative value is specified the time is calculated based on the health of the besieged force.:::::siege_escalation_damage_required_to_reach_escalation_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Amount of damage required to reach escalation level one.:::::siege_escalation_level_at_which_wall_damage_causes_breaches;;;;;(IN GAME) The siege escalation level that must be reached before damaging the walls will cause wall breaches.:::::siege_max_force_siege_effort;;;;;(IN GAME) Max siege effort which a force can provide:::::siege_min_force_siege_effort;;;;;(IN GAME) Min siege effort which a force can provide:::::slave_points_mod;;;;;(IN GAME) Slave point multiplier for captured cities and post battle captives:::::state_religion_conversion_bonus;;;;;Bonus for state religion conversion (per region you own in a province):::::trade_commerce_raiding_maximum_raiding_permille;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum proportion of a trade route which may be commerce raided, in thousandths.:::::trade_commerce_raiding_reduction_per_ship;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of this ships commerce raid value that the next commerce raiding ship downstream on this route will achieve.:::::trade_demand_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The constant factor by which a factions gdp is multiplied to produce the faction trade resource consumption.:::::trade_luxury_resource_strategic_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The strategic value in trade for luxury resources or any resource which is already available to a faction.:::::trade_price_large_change_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum absolute difference between the current and target prices of a trade resource for the price change to be considered large.:::::trade_price_small_change_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum absolute difference between the current and target prices of a trade resource for the price change to be considered small.:::::trade_resource_region_gdp_contribution;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of trade resource value each resource not traded on to other factions contributes to total income:::::trade_route_value_accumulator_degredation_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) Each turn the accumulated proportion of trade route values (\"time value\") is this proportion compared to the previous turn.:::::trade_route_value_accumulator_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of the trade route value that gets accumulated each turn, \"time factor\".:::::trade_route_value_combined_gdp_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of the combined gdps of the two factions which contributes to the value of a trade route.:::::trade_route_value_minimum_tariff;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum proportion of the square root of the sum of the involved faction\'s gdps that either faction will recieve in a trade deal.:::::tunnel_interception_chance_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Base percentage chance of intercepting a tunnelling army.:::::tunnel_interception_chance_tunnelled_last_turn;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional percentage chance of intercepting a tunnelling army if this army tunnelled last turn.:::::tunnel_interception_range;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum distance at which armies can intercept tunnelling armies. Clamped between 0.1 and 25.0:::::undercover_character_base_cover_points_change_per_turn;;;;;(IN GAME) Base cover point change per turn before bonuses. DESIGN NOTE - If this is set to anything other than 1, it seems that all modifiers actually MULTIPLY it by the given amount rather than add - eg if this is set to 10, a +4 cover point bonus will mean that a character has 50 CP per turn.:::::undercover_character_base_maximum_cover_points;;;;;(IN GAME) Maxmimum cover points a character can have:::::undercover_character_base_percentage_chance_of_secondary_discover_outcome;;;;;(IN GAME) base percentage of secondary discover option outcome (e.g. faction chooses execute but character escapes):::::undercover_character_discovered_hirable_character_relationship_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) relationship value between the undercover character and another character in the faction to be considered for hire on discover:::::undercover_character_lower_bound_rounds_in_target_faction_pool;;;;;(IN GAME) Lower random value - length of time undercover characters will spend in the targets character pool without being hired:::::undercover_character_lower_threshold_for_automatic_return_to_source_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) if undercover character reaches this loyalty in a foreign faction, they automatically leav them:::::undercover_character_max_loyalty_to_accept_hire;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover character can be hired by discovering faction if loyalty to discover function is >= this:::::undercover_character_min_loyalty_to_refuse_counter_undercover;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover character refused to counterspy loyalty to source faction is <= this:::::undercover_character_percentage_chance_of_enabler_for_newly_created_character;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage chance of a newly created character having the undercover character enabler:::::undercover_character_percentage_chance_of_enabler_for_recruitable_character;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage chance (0-100) that a new recruitable character can be an undercover character:::::undercover_character_rank_for_all_map_characters_los;;;;;(IN GAME) rank requirement to provide line of sight to all map characters - may not be the sole requirement:::::undercover_character_rank_for_spouse_los;;;;;(IN GAME) rank requirement to provide line of sight to spouse - may not be the sole requirement:::::undercover_character_turncoat_cost_multiplier_base;;;;;(IN GAME) The multiplier to use in the costing formula for turncoats.:::::undercover_character_turncoat_cover_points_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Starting amount of cover points given to recruited turncoat spies:::::undercover_character_turncoat_cover_points_per_rank;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional cover points per rank in the faction:::::undercover_character_turncoat_potential_base;;;;;(IN_GAME) Base potential to use in turncoat calculations:::::undercover_character_turns_loyal_original_loyalty_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) To calculate the number of turns before a spy defects to its current faction. THIS * original loyalty to source.:::::undercover_character_upkeep_calculation_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier on the undercover character upkeep calculation. Currently (max loyalty + 1 - current loyalty) * THIS:::::undercover_character_upper_bound_rounds_in_target_faction_pool;;;;;(IN GAME) Upper random value - length of time undercover characters will spend in the targets character pool without being hired:::::undercover_character_upper_loyalty_threshold_for_automatic_join_current_faction;;;;;(IN GAME) if undercover character reaches this loyalty in a foreign faction, they automatically join them:::::undercover_network_maximum_points;;;;;(IN GAME) maximum undercover network points for a target faction:::::undercover_network_point_decay_if_inactive;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points REDUCTION if no spies in target faction:::::undercover_network_points_for_candidate;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_faction_leader;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_family_member;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_general;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_governor;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_hier;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_minister;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::undercover_network_points_for_recruited_character;;;;;(IN GAME) undercover network points gained per turn if character is in this position:::::unit_battle_setup_night_battle_attacker_fatigue_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Fatigue penalty for all attackers in a night battle.:::::unit_battle_setup_night_battle_defender_morale_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Morale bonus for units defending night battles. Result will be morale + THIS.:::::unit_experience_modifier_on_unit_replenishment;;;;;(IN GAME) Controls what percentage of XP of the replenished unit is granted to the newly replenished men. This value is then scaled by the proportion of new unit size that the additional men represent.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_capacity_casualties_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiple of battle site casualties in vampire mercenary recruitment capacity calculation.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_capacity_tier_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Unit tier modifier in vampire mercenary recruitment capacity calculation.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_max_capacity;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum additional capacity for vampiric mercenary pools.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_max_replenishment_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum additional percentage by which vampiric mercenary pools will replenish per turn.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_min_capacity;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum additional capacity for vampiric mercenary pools.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_min_replenishment_percentage;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum additional percentage by which vampiric mercenary pools will replenish per turn.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_replenishment_casualties_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiple of battle site casualties in vampire mercenary recruitment replenishment calculation.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_replenishment_tier_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Unit tier modifier in vampire mercenary recruitment replenishment calculation.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_value_for_max_capacity;;;;;(IN GAME) Capacity value required from bonus values and campaign variables to give the maximum additional vampiric mercenary pool capacity.:::::vampiric_mercenary_recruitment_value_for_max_replenishment;;;;;(IN GAME) Replenishment value required from bonus values and campaign variables to give the maximum additional vampiric mercenary pool replenishment rate.:::::winds_of_magic_change_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance of the Winds of Magic changing at the start of round.:::::wounds_to_restore_on_faction_transfer;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of wounds restored when a character is reassigned to a new faction:::::zone_of_control_land_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius of the zone of control for land pieces. Clamped between 0.1 and 8.0:::::zone_of_control_naval_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius of the zone of control for naval pieces. Clamped between 0.1 and 15.0",
            },
        },
        "ccp_balance_values_tables": {
            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "balance_best_accuracy;;;;;Modifier used to provide accuracy for ranged damage calculations:::::balance_cavalry_med_charge_speed;;;;;Reference charge speed for an average cavalry unit:::::balance_cavalry_med_mass;;;;;Reference mass for an average cavalry unit:::::balance_charge_per_minute;;;;;Number of charges a cav unit will do in a minute, for collision calculations.:::::balance_default_mass;;;;;Reference mass for an average unit:::::balance_explosion_damage_multiplier;;;;;Modifier used to scaled explosion base and ap damages:::::balance_infantry_med_mass;;;;;Reference mass for an average infantry unit:::::balance_intended_battle_length;;;;;The battle length in minutes:::::balance_men_hit_by_charge;;;;;Modifier multiplied with the balance_number_of_men_in_melee value in collision calculations:::::balance_men_hit_by_charger;;;;;Number of men hit by charger:::::balance_moral;;;;;Modifier that will be multiplied with the unit moral:::::balance_number_of_men_in_melee;;;;;Used in collision calculation as the amount of men that will be met:::::balance_reference_ammo;;;;;Value used to calculate the ammo modifier.:::::balance_reference_attack_rate;;;;;Number of attacks per min:::::balance_reference_missile_range;;;;;The reference missile range:::::balance_sigmoid_max;;;;;balance_sigmoid_max:::::balance_sigmoid_midpoint;;;;;Sigmoid Midpoint:::::balance_sigmoid_steepness;;;;;balance_sigmoid_steepness:::::base_range_modifier;;;;;Used in the range modifier calculation:::::ccp_reliability;;;;;CCP Reliability - 0(Green), 1(Orange), 2(Red):::::fallback_delta_proportion;;;;;Modifier used to provide deltas in the event of records failing to load:::::hero_splash;;;;;Modifier used in some vague way to bias melee charge damage for heroes:::::mass_variation_constant;;;;;Average over all entity mass variations:::::max_ammo_coefficient;;;;;Used to calculate the ammo modifier:::::max_range_modifier;;;;;Used in the range modifier calculation:::::min_range_modifier;;;;;Used in the range modifier calculation:::::minimum_melee_resistance;;;;;Ugly hack put in by Atilla so his horrible balance spreadsheet will work:::::price_point_melee_damage;;;;;Price point from excel formula:::::price_point_melee_resistance;;;;;Price point from excel formula:::::price_point_morale;;;;;Price point from excel formula:::::price_point_range_damage;;;;;Price point from excel formula:::::price_point_range_resistance;;;;;Price point from excel formula:::::range_mod_steepness;;;;;Used in the range modifier calculation:::::weight_armour_defence;;;;;Modifier used to scale armour defence:::::weight_armour_defence_shield;;;;;Modifier used to scale armour defence shield:::::weight_cavalry_jump_attack;;;;;Modifier used to scale cavalry jump attack:::::weight_effective_melee_hp;;;;;Modifier used to scale the effective melee hp value:::::weight_effective_ranged_hp;;;;;Modifier used to scale the effective ranged hp value:::::weight_fraction_of_men_firing;;;;;The percentage of a ranged unit firing:::::weight_fraction_of_men_in_melee;;;;;The percentage of the unit that should be involved in melee:::::weight_hero_effective_ranged_hp;;;;;Modifier used to scale heroes effective ranged hp:::::weight_melee_defence;;;;;Modifier used to scale melee defence:::::weight_melee_defence_shield;;;;;Modifier used to scale melee defence shield:::::weight_missile_ap_damage_over_battle;;;;;Modifier that will be multiplied by the ap ranged damage in calculations:::::weight_missile_block_chance;;;;;Modifier used in the effective ranged hp calculation:::::weight_missile_regular_damage_over_battle;;;;;Modifier that will be multiplied by the base ranged damage in calculations:::::weight_total_ap_damage_over_battle;;;;;Modifier that will be multiplied with the base ap damage in calculations:::::weight_total_melee_armour;;;;;Modifier used to scale the total melee armour:::::weight_total_melee_damage_over_battle;;;;;Modifier that will be multiplied with the base melee damage in calculations:::::weight_total_melee_defence;;;;;Modifier used to scale the total defence value",
            },
        },
        "cdir_events_targets_tables": {
            "target_key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "default;;;;;:::::mission_objective;;;;;Every mission requires only one objective target, there can be multiple other targets that are not part of the objective:::::target_character_1;;;;;:::::target_character_2;;;;;:::::target_character_3;;;;;:::::target_faction_1;;;;;:::::target_faction_2;;;;;:::::target_faction_3;;;;;:::::target_military_1;;;;;:::::target_military_2;;;;;:::::target_region_1;;;;;:::::target_region_2;;;;;:::::target_settlement_1;;;;;:::::target_settlement_2;;;;;:::::target_slot_1;;;;;:::::target_slot_2;;;;;:::::target_technology_1;;;;;:::::target_technology_2;;;;;",
            },
        },
        "ceo_to_ui_display_junctions_tables": {
